# PLO_LOADGANI (195), compiled gani: the world runs its NPC server, so a gani with a GS2 SCRIPT section is compiled
# and sent as PLO_GANISCRIPT. The server's own 195 is dropped throughout.
waitsession 240
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 8
drop s2c 195
mark K1 probes3 (GS2 SCRIPT, file SETBACKTO sit), no 195
s2c 9 c:10 str:probes3
sleep 5
mark K2 probes2 (same, no SCRIPT), no 195
s2c 9 c:10 str:probes2
sleep 5
mark K3 probes3 again with 195 SETBACKTO dead
s2c 195 str:probes3 hex:225345544241434b544f206465616422
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:probes3
sleep 5
mark END
sleep 2
